# Documentation
# Hayabusa 4.1+ compound module. Does not replace stock Compound\Hayabusa.mkape (live).
# Use after collecting EventLogs / CombinedLogs (msource = collected EVTX tree).
# Leaf modules live under Modules\Apps\Local\Hayabusa\.
# Optional: hayabusa_OfflineEventLogs_High_v41.mkape instead of / in addition to standard timeline.
